#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/linear-mode-connectivity.md:13
msgid ""
"As two same-init SGD runs train longer, their direct parameter interpolation develops"
" a larger loss barrier, while a learned quadratic Bezier path remains low-loss at 50k"
" steps."
msgstr "两个采用相同初始化的 SGD 训练运行得越久，其参数的直接插值产生的损失屏障就越高；而在 50k 步时，经过学习的二次 Bezier 路径仍能保持低损失。"

