#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/linear-mode-connectivity.md:43
msgid ""
"This example studies a minimal mode-connectivity contrast on CIFAR-10. Two ResNet "
"classifiers share an initialization and differ only in training-seed randomness. "
"Direct interpolation between their parameters becomes increasingly unfavorable during"
" training, but a quadratic Bezier path optimized at 50k steps removes most of the "
"barrier. This is a controlled phenomenon reproduction, not the original paper's "
"multi-architecture, independently initialized benchmark."
msgstr ""
"本示例在 CIFAR-10 上考察一个最简的 mode connectivity 对比。两个 ResNet "
"分类器使用相同初始化，只在训练 seed 的随机性上不同。随着训练进行，两者参数之间的直接插值越来越不利；但在 50k "
"步时优化得到的二次 Bezier 路径能消除大部分屏障。这是一次受控的现象复现，并非原论文涵盖多种架构和独立初始化的基准实验。"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/linear-mode-connectivity.md:51
msgid ""
"**Paper:** [Loss Surfaces, Mode Connectivity, and Fast Ensembling of "
"DNNs](https://arxiv.org/abs/1802.10026), Timur Garipov, Pavel Izmailov, Dmitrii "
"Podoprikhin, Dmitry Vetrov, and Andrew Gordon Wilson (NeurIPS 2018)"
msgstr ""
"**论文：** [DNN 的损失曲面、模式连通性和快速集成](https://arxiv.org/abs/1802.10026)，Timur Garipov、Pavel "
"Izmailov、Dmitrii Podoprikhin、Dmitry Vetrov 和 Andrew Gordon Wilson (NeurIPS 2018)"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/linear-mode-connectivity.md:55
msgid "**Template:** `repro: Linear Mode Connectivity (CIFAR-10, same init)`"
msgstr "**模板：** `repro: Linear Mode Connectivity (CIFAR-10, same init)`"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/linear-mode-connectivity.md:57
msgid "**Template ID:** `repro-linear-mode-connectivity-cifar10`"
msgstr "**模板 ID：** `repro-linear-mode-connectivity-cifar10`"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/linear-mode-connectivity.md:59
msgid "Reproduction Goal"
msgstr "复现目标"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/linear-mode-connectivity.md:61
msgid ""
"Garipov et al. show that low-loss neural-network solutions can be connected by simple"
" curves with nearly constant accuracy. This template tests the most direct visual "
"consequence: a poor straight parameter path need not mean that the two endpoints are "
"disconnected."
msgstr "Garipov 等人表明，低损失神经网络解可以由准确率近乎不变的简单曲线连接。本模板检验最直接的可视化结论：一条表现不佳的直线参数路径，并不意味着两个端点彼此断开。"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/linear-mode-connectivity.md:66
msgid "For endpoint checkpoints $\\theta_A$ and $\\theta_B$, the linear evaluator measures"
msgstr "对于两个端点 checkpoint $\\theta_A$ 和 $\\theta_B$，线性评估器计算"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/linear-mode-connectivity.md:69
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\theta(\\alpha) = (1-\\alpha)\\theta_A + \\alpha\\theta_B.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\\theta(\\alpha) = (1-\\alpha)\\theta_A + \\alpha\\theta_B.\n"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/linear-mode-connectivity.md:73
msgid ""
"At 50k steps, the curve evaluator keeps the endpoints fixed and optimizes one "
"quadratic Bezier control point $\\theta_C$:"
msgstr "在 50k 步时，曲线评估器固定两个端点，并优化一个二次 Bezier 控制点 $\\theta_C$："

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/linear-mode-connectivity.md:76
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\theta(t) = (1-t)^2\\theta_A + 2t(1-t)\\theta_C + t^2\\theta_B.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\\theta(t) = (1-t)^2\\theta_A + 2t(1-t)\\theta_C + t^2\\theta_B.\n"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/linear-mode-connectivity.md:80
msgid ""
"The phenomenon is a large linear loss barrier paired with a much smaller Bezier "
"barrier."
msgstr "要复现的现象是：线性路径存在较高的损失屏障，而 Bezier 路径的屏障小得多。"

