#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/linear-mode-connectivity.md:149
msgid ""
"Comfy Research canvas for the 50k-step CIFAR-10 linear mode connectivity run, "
"including the two endpoint trainers, linear interpolation barrier, and optimized "
"quadratic Bezier path."
msgstr "用于 50k 步 CIFAR-10 线性 mode connectivity 运行的 Comfy Research 画布，包含两个端点 Trainer、线性插值屏障和优化后的二次 Bezier 路径。"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/linear-mode-connectivity.md:153
msgid ""
"**50k endpoint pair.** The direct linear path crosses a pronounced loss barrier, "
"whereas the optimized quadratic Bezier curve preserves low loss and accuracy along "
"most of the path."
msgstr "**50k 端点对。** 直接线性路径跨越明显的损失屏障；优化后的二次 Bezier 曲线则在大部分路径上保持低损失和较高准确率。"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/linear-mode-connectivity.md:158
msgid "Interpretation"
msgstr "解释"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/linear-mode-connectivity.md:160
msgid ""
"**Linear disconnection emerges during training.** The near-monotonic growth from "
"0.2377 at 1k to 1.8985 at 50k is consistent with two trajectories progressively "
"specializing into parameter configurations that are poorly combined by direct "
"averaging."
msgstr ""
"**训练过程中出现线性不连通。** 屏障从 1k 时的 0.2377 增至 50k 时的 1.8985，近乎单调。这与两条轨迹逐渐形成难以通过直接平均组合的参数配置相符。"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/linear-mode-connectivity.md:164
msgid ""
"**Loss retains information after accuracy saturates.** From 5k onward, the accuracy "
"drop stays near 14--16 points while the cross-entropy barrier keeps increasing. The "
"interpolated model therefore loses predictive confidence and margin even when top-1 "
"error changes less."
msgstr ""
"**准确率饱和后，损失仍提供信息。** 从 5k 开始，准确率降幅维持在约 14--16 个百分点，而交叉熵屏障持续增大。因此，即使 top-1 "
"误差变化不大，插值模型的预测置信度和分类间隔仍在下降。"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/linear-mode-connectivity.md:168
msgid ""
"**The barrier belongs to the straight path.** At 50k, the quadratic Bezier path "
"lowers the loss barrier by about 96%. In this setting, the low-loss region is "
"connected but strongly non-convex: the Euclidean segment leaves it, while a simple "
"curved route remains."
msgstr ""
"**屏障属于直线路径。** 在 50k 步时，二次 Bezier 路径将损失屏障降低约 "
"96%。在此设置下，低损失区域彼此连通但高度非凸：欧几里得线段会离开该区域，而一条简单的曲线路径仍可留在其中。"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/linear-mode-connectivity.md:173
msgid ""
"The result is consistent with parameter specialization or misalignment across the SGD"
" runs, such as incompatible internal feature bases, channel organizations, or "
"normalization scales. This experiment does not identify the precise mechanism because"
" it does not include permutation alignment or representation analysis."
msgstr "这一结果与两次 SGD 训练中的参数专化或错位相符，例如内部特征基、通道组织或归一化尺度彼此不兼容。由于实验未进行置换对齐或表征分析，无法确定确切机制。"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/linear-mode-connectivity.md:179
msgid "Limitations"
msgstr "局限性"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/linear-mode-connectivity.md:181
msgid ""
"The endpoints share an initialization; the paper also studies independently "
"initialized solutions and more architectures."
msgstr "两个端点共享同一初始化；论文还研究了独立初始化的解及更多架构。"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/linear-mode-connectivity.md:183
msgid "One CIFAR-10 ResNet pair does not establish seed robustness or universality."
msgstr "单独一对 CIFAR-10 ResNet 不足以证明对 seed 的稳健性或结果的普适性。"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/linear-mode-connectivity.md:184
msgid ""
